<title>MALAYSIA: HOCKEY-FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from a Four-Nation</p>
<p>hockey tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    South Korea   5    Switzerland   0   (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Shin Seok Kyo (12th, 17th, 50th minutes), Yoo Mun</p>
<p>Ki (35th), Hong Kyung Seub (55th)</p>
<p>    Malaysia	9    Belgium	 5   (halftime 3-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malaysia - Nor Saiful Zaini (1st, 33rd), M. Kaliswaran</p>
<p>(28th, 38th, 51st), Aphtar Singh (39th, 40th), Maninderjit Singh</p>
<p>(49th), Arul Selvaraj (69th)</p>
<p>Belgium - Patrick Pille (4th), Joeri Buenen (43rd, 50th),</p>
<p>Michel Kinnen (48th), Alexandre De Chaffoy (66th)</p>
</text>
